The '''Jungle''' is an island. The island hosts quests for players from levels 10-30, making it the second lowest-level island. This island also contains the [[Saber Expert]] boss that can be found by doing the [[Saber/Puzzle|Saber Puzzle]] for the [[Saber]] sword. There are quests that allow players to reach secret levels that are not part of the normal level progression. 

==Appearance==
The Jungle consists of two parts of islands, one smaller than the other, each having different enemies. They both are filled with trees and rocks, however, the larger island contains [[Monkey]]s and stone structures, while the smaller one has [[Gorilla]]s instead and lacks stone structures. The smaller island also has the [[Gorilla King]] boss in the right side of the Jungle.

