== Secret Quests ==

* A Grappling Hook can be found on the ground next to a tree on the [[The Gorilla King|Gorilla King]]. The tree is the closest one to the other island. After picking up the Grappling Hook, the player must climb onto the platform located on one side of the tree and stand at its edge. The Grappling Hook can then be aimed at the corresponding attachment point on the other island. The attachment point will be highlighted in green when it can be targeted.
Another quest can be done using these steps. First, the player must check with the [[Adventurer]] and pick the rumor dialogue. If they say that a monkey stole their hat, the player can continue on with the next step. The player must hit a random tree with footsteps leading toward it (a notably medium-large-sized one) using [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] M1s to make a monkey fall out, then defeat it, and collect the hat that drops at the base of the tree. The hat must then be given to the Adventurer.

Important information: The footprints will only appear during the awakened boss event until his death. (The awakened boss doesn't have to be the Gorilla King)<gallery>
