== Trivia ==
* The [[Soundtracks|theme]] that plays at the Jungle is called 'Into The Forest'.
* According to the [[Secrets Master]], the Jungle is facing a biodiversity crisis, because many of the trees look exactly the same.
* The Jungle is one of the few islands in the game to have a true lake, another one being [[Hydra Island]].
* [[Blox Fruits]] spawn in the Jungle naturally quite often since the island has a lot of [[Trees]].
* As of [[Updates#23|Update 23]], there is a safe zone near the [[Blox Fruit Gacha]]. However, it was moved to [[Middle Town]] in [[Updates/30|Update 30]].
* The community often regards the Jungle as the most popular place in the [[First Sea]].
* The [[Saber/Puzzle]] can be found in the Jungle, as well as the [[Saber Expert]], who gives the user the [[Saber]]. 
* An animation plays each time the player encounters the boss, unless they have defeated the boss at least once since the update.

